Space=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8B2F2B;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="960" width="290" height="158" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="RECOVERY TOKEN LIFECYCLE — ORDER OF OPERATIONS&#10;1.  DF3 / DF4   identity verification against DS1&#10;2.  DF6 / DF7   token generated by P2, stored in DS2&#10;3.  DF8 / DF8a  token issued to the user via P1&#10;4.  DF9 / DF10  user submits the token back to P2&#10;5.  DF11 / DF12 token validated against DS2&#10;6.  DF13        token consumed / invalidated in DS2&#10;7.  DF14        authorized profile update released to P3&#10;Validation (DF12) always precedes profile update (DF14)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7F6000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1760" y="960" width="460" height="232" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note2" value="P4 — LIMITED AUTHORITY&#10;P4 does not authenticate the user, authorize&#10;recovery, generate or validate tokens, or modify&#10;profiles. It has no connection to DS1 or DS2.&#10;It receives only approved account context from&#10;P2 on DF21." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F4E79;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1170" width="320" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note3" value="EE2 IS OUTSIDE APPLICATION CONTROL&#10;P5 is the only component that communicates&#10;with EE2. EE2 has no connection to DS1, DS2,&#10;P2 or P3. LLM output is untrusted and cannot&#10;trigger authentication, authorization, recovery,&#10;token operations or profile modification." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5B3A6B;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2270" y="900" wi